sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as Kubernetes Job<br/>(External Orchestrator)
    participant CLI as sft_trainer.py<br/>CLI Entrypoint
    participant Config as tuning-config-recommender
    participant DataFmt as Data Formatter
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant Trainer as SFT Trainer<br/>(transformers + peft + trl)
    participant GPU as GPU / Accelerator<br/>(flash-attn / fms-acceleration)
    participant Tracker as Experiment Tracker<br/>(Aim / MLflow / ClearML)

    Orchestrator->>CLI: Launch tuning job<br/>(CLI args + env vars)

    Note over CLI: Reads S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID,<br/>S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY,<br/>S3_ENDPOINT from env

    CLI->>Config: Request optimal config<br/>(model size, GPU count)
    Config-->>CLI: Recommended hyperparameters

    CLI->>DataFmt: Initialize data pipeline
    DataFmt->>S3: Fetch training dataset<br/>HTTPS / TLS<br/>Auth: AWS IAM (boto3)
    S3-->>DataFmt: Dataset artifacts
    DataFmt->>DataFmt: Format & tokenize dataset

    CLI->>Trainer: Start SFT training<br/>(model, dataset, config)

    loop Training Loop (per epoch)
        Trainer->>GPU: Forward/backward pass<br/>(PEFT adapters)
        GPU-->>Trainer: Gradients
        Trainer->>Trainer: Update weights<br/>(HF Accelerate)
        Trainer->>Tracker: Log metrics<br/>(loss, lr, throughput)
    end

    Trainer-->>CLI: Training complete<br/>(adapter weights)

    Note over CLI: Saves model artifacts<br/>to local storage or<br/>configured output path

    CLI-->>Orchestrator: Exit code 0 (success)
